# Studyverse — Realtime Environment Variables
# For worldwide cross-device multiplayer presence, connect a free Supabase project:
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Go to Project Settings -> API
# 3. Enable Realtime -> Presence
# 4. Fill in your project URL and anon public key below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...your-anon-key...

# NOTE: If these variables are not set or left as defaults, Studyverse automatically runs
# in Local Peer Multiplayer Mode using BroadcastChannel and WebStorage events.
# You can test multiplayer instantly on your machine simply by opening two browser windows or tabs!

